  "description": "In-process mediator for .NET with ambient DI scope by default, CanHandle handler preconditions, [HandlerOrder] ordering and a path to distributed messaging via EventFlux.RabbitFlow and EventFlux.RedisFlow. Lightweight in-process CQRS library with send/publish, pipeline behaviors, built-in logging and timeout, and deferred batch dispatch.",
